          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.153,
            0.847,
            0.192
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. The Earth travels approximately 940 million kilometres around the Sun in a year. How many kilometres will it travel in a week?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.199,
            0.482,
            0.217
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " We have 52 weeks in a year."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.218,
            0.54,
            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We know that 1 million = 10 lakh"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.238,
            0.567,
            0.257
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So 940 million km = 940,000,000 km"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.259,
            0.395,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, 940000000 : 52"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.208,
            0.278,
            0.784,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let x be the number of kilometers it travels in a week then"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.3,
            0.335,
            0.329
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_25_equation_9.jpg",
          "content": "\\frac{940000000}{52}=\\frac{x}{1}"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.331,
            0.36,
            0.349
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_25_equation_10.jpg",
          "content": "\\mathrm{or} \\; x = 18076923"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.204,
            0.35,
            0.675,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hence the Earth travels 18076923 km in a week."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.379,
            0.618,
            0.528
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. A mason is building a house in the shape shown in the diagram. He needs to construct both the outer walls and the inner wall that separates two rooms. To build a wall of 10-feet, he requires approximately 1450 bricks. How many bricks would he need to build the house? Assume all walls are of the same height and thickness."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.625,
            0.382,
            0.869,
            0.512
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.625,
                0.382,
                0.869,
                0.512
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_25_image_13.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.535,
            0.562,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Bricks required for 10 ft wall = 1450"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.555,
            0.422,
            0.573
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Than ratio is 10:1450"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.574,
            0.846,
            0.613
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now total length of walls = 12 + 12 + 12 + 15 + 9 + 15 + 9 + 9 + 9 + 6 = 108 ft."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.615,
            0.514,
            0.633
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let no. of bricks required be x,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.635,
            0.433,
            0.653
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now 10 : 1450 :: 108 : x"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.656,
            0.446,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Or, x = "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1450 × 108",
              "styles": [
                "underline"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 15660 10"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.21,
            0.687,
            0.584,
            0.706
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Number of bricks required are 15660."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
